const L_CORE = `LANE: core (foundation — every other lane imports you; get the APIs exactly right).
Files you own: ${HB}/scene3d/film/core/{errors.js, vec3.js, quat.js, gimbal.js, spline.js, easing.js, spring.js, rng.js, noise.js, units.js}; tests ${HB}/tests/film_core_math.test.mjs, ${HB}/tests/film_gimbal.test.mjs, ${HB}/tests/film_spline.test.mjs.
Implement SPEC §1 conventions and §2.1–2.8 exactly (plus errors.js: FilmError, FilmShotError, FilmPlanError with a .code field).
Key requirements:
- gimbal.js: basisFromHPR must be orthonormal and right-handed for ALL h,p in a grid including p = ±π/2 exactly; quatFromHPR ↔ basisFromHPR consistent; hprFromQuat(quatFromHPR(h,p,r), hint) round-trips (wrap-aware) and uses the hint at the poles. lookRotation never NaN; holds heading inside the cone. createLookController: implement yaw-slew / pitch-through / hold exactly as SPEC §2.3; smoothing via critically damped springs on angles (unwrap-aware); rate limits enforced.
- acQuatToThree / acToThreePos: verify in tests with REAL three: for many random (h,p,r), build THREE.Quaternion(...acQuatToThree(q)); the three camera forward = (0,0,-1).applyQuaternion(qThree) must equal acToThreePos(forward_ac) and three up = (0,1,0).applyQuaternion(qThree) must equal acToThreePos(up_ac) (1e-9).
- A "pass-over" test: eye moves north at 10 m/s over a target 20 m below (fps 30, 8 s), controller in yaw-slew mode: outputs continuous, |Δh| ≤ maxYawRate·dt + 1e-9 every frame, pitch reaches ≤ −89° near overhead, no NaN; in pitch-through mode the camera forward keeps pointing at the target within 3° after settling; in hold mode heading constant inside the cone.
- spline.js: catmullRom passes through control points; makePath arc-length uniformity (|at(s+ds)-at(s)| ≈ ds within 0.5%); filletPolyline on an L-shaped corridor (90° turn) produces an arc tangent to both legs with the requested radius (clamped by 0.45×segment); speedLimitedProfile is monotone, ends at path length, respects v ≤ √(alat/κ) on a tight arc.
- spring.js: critDamp exact solution matches small-step Euler integration; no overshoot; createSecondOrder stable for dt up to 1 s.
- easing.js: all easings f(0)=0,f(1)=1, monotone (sampled); trapezoid/sCurve profiles reach the distance at duration with v ≤ vmax, |a| ≤ amax.
- units.js: round trips world<->local<->map; Holtburg sanity: LB 0xA9B4 contains map ≈ 42.1N 33.6E; telelocCmd formatting "@teleloc 0xA9B4001C 84.00 112.00 66.00 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000" style (choose fixed decimals and document); headingQuat convention qw=cos(θ/2), qz=−sin(θ/2); lbKey always unsigned (>>> 0) — test with x byte ≥ 0x80.
- noise/rng: deterministic per seed; shake amplitudes bounded.`

